      "mergeID": "5c2968a5293e976b9f8dad87",
      "mergedPostDetails": "In the beta 2017 client I placed my avatars hand behind the mirror and it seemed to still have it there, but appear to pop out of the mirror in my vision and I could touch my own face. I switched to a default avatar to see if it was just because it was a 5.6 avatar, but the issue still persisted, an image is attached.",
