      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This bug still NOT fixed. Tested in latest open beta with VRCSDK-2018.12.04.10.25_Public\nWorld was uploaded with Unity 2017.4.15f1\nTest world ID: wrld_27d044b8-3e7e-4c2e-8501-028195bb44f4",
