      "statusChangeID": "5c2968358a10424814af73b4",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "This is fixed when both the avatar and mirror have been updated with Unity 2017.4.15f1.\n\nWorlds that are still on 5.6 (you can see this in the Menu+2 debug menu) and avatars that weren't updated to 2017 yet will have this issue.",
